## Problem Statement – Gym Member Management Using Linked List
Develop a Gym Member Management System using a Singly Linked List to perform the following operations:
Insert Record – Add a new gym member with Member ID, Name, and Membership Type.
Delete Record – Delete a gym member using their Member ID.
Search Record – Search for a gym member using their Member ID and display their details.
Display Records – Display all the gym members stored in the linked list.
Exit – Terminate the program.
